OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after woman dies in
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash on A8
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fmulti-vehicle crash on the A8 near
OL,8,FEdinburgh Airport on Monday in which a
OL,9,Fwoman died.
OL,11,FPolice said two women, aged 23 and 19,
OL,12,Fand a 32-year-old man were arrested in
OL,13,Fconnection with the crash, which
OL,14,Fhappened at around 09:25 near
OL,15,FNewbridge.
OL,17,FOfficers previously said they were
OL,18,Ftrying to trace the occupants of a grey
OL,19,FMercedes A250 who had left the scene of
OL,20,Fthe collision on foot.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
